        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"d4de2036-2be5-4a20-ae34-a7669ae05f88\",\"review_text\":\"This app don't have basic feature that a music player have\"},{\"review_id\":\"b7165637-6ce0-48de-85f5-fe35f54b5965\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent 👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"c0265ca3-2bfc-4c51-8523-e46308bc0718\",\"review_text\":\"All songs you will get here of high quality.. Too good\"},{\"review_id\":\"e8eca07d-5872-4188-923b-1633a4acce9c\",\"review_text\":\"My favorite music streaming platform because of how easy it is to find new music on there and literally just get premium it's so worth it the only complaints I hear are from people without premium like literally just get the full service and stop complaining that your broke.\"},{\"review_id\":\"16b60d9e-5dcc-4c37-89fa-61614e81ca8a\",\"review_text\":\"Very good for music\"},{\"review_id\":\"18e104e3-493e-476e-bec4-fc87b10de930\",\"review_text\":\"Bad App Very Bad App\"},{\"review_id\":\"8d6efa7d-d36c-44dd-ab20-0d4ec2c0767a\",\"review_text\":\"Was great but now it won't play anything\"},{\"review_id\":\"9888f76c-a380-47f2-b017-2867d290ac23\",\"review_text\":\"Exelent quality music\"},{\"review_id\":\"8ba96b9d-2617-4174-a217-febfc2e3ee92\",\"review_text\":\"I really wish I had a button to dislike artists or songs played so I stop hearing them. Really ruins it when I have a good stream going then some random garbage band keeps popping up disrupting my Playlist.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9138e5f5-0485-4405-bc39-45dbccdccc56\",\"review_text\":\"Plezz add offline songs play in faverable songs\"}]}"
